.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-pubkey 1  "oct-pubkey " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-pubkey \- Export the key data on a card as an OpenPGP public key
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct pubkey\fR <\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-card\fR> [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-user\-pin\fR] <\fB\-u\fR|\fB\-\-userid\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Export the key data on a card as an OpenPGP public key
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-card\fR \fI<card ident>\fR
Identifier of the card to use
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-user\-pin\fR \fI<User PIN file>\fR
Optionally, get User PIN from a file
.TP
\fB\-u\fR, \fB\-\-userid\fR \fI<User ID>\fR
User ID to add to the exported certificate representation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
